  "scope": "Post-attribution,TRAIN-only geometry diagnostic.First512 original TRAIN feature views and all32 tail queries.Fixed trained one-step vs its original random initialization.No vocabulary projection,loss,targets,held-out rescoring or model update.Compute attention entropy/effective support,self/top1 weights,value-mean energy,weighted-vs-uniform context and final-correction differences.Report all three source domains and unchanged parameter versions.The initialized output is zero by construction;zero initial output differences are not evidence of useful computation.No new promotion threshold or fit. Separately registered after observing sharpened attention:measure first-key/first-four/last-eight attention mass,top-key early-position frequencies and expected relative key position on the same TRAIN features.Check for positional concentration without interpreting it as causal reasoning or running any new prediction score.",
